    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They See Us</strong> is a horror anomaly-hunting experience inspired by psychological horrors like 'Cabin Factory' and '<i>The Exit 8</i>' with the added chaos of multiplayer and deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.poster.avif?t=1755692170\" width=594 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.webm?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.mp4?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of countless <strong>Cipactli Dynamics</strong> employees. Your newly allocated job is to explore the dark Office Creation and report the number of anomalies you find.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct answers progress you to the next stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incorrect answers will result in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.poster.avif?t=1755692170\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.webm?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.mp4?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.poster.avif?t=1755692170\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.webm?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.mp4?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 human players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOIP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient 'clicker' counter to keep track of anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lockers to hide in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team video feeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmaking and Steam Friend invitations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Petable Dog.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.poster.avif?t=1755692170\" width=594 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.webm?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.mp4?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/c0d1ea0d6acf93aa3ca3a965eebcd880.avif?t=1755692170\" data-has-big width=800 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For millennia, <strong>Cipactli Dynamics</strong> has stood as a beacon of resilience, wisdom, and progress. With roots reaching deep into the past, we have preserved traditions of strength and vision, adapting through the ages to shape the future. Our commitment to innovation, longevity, and influence has positioned us as an enduring force in industries across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Cipactli Dynamics, we believe in <strong>continuity beyond generations</strong>\u2014an unbroken chain of knowledge and power that stretches from the world\u2019s earliest civilizations into the boundless possibilities of tomorrow. Our methods are time-honoured, our reach unparalleled, and our <strong>dedication to what lies beyond</strong> remains absolute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The past is our foundation. The future is our domain.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They See Us</strong> is a horror anomaly-hunting experience inspired by psychological horrors like 'Cabin Factory' and '<i>The Exit 8</i>' with the added chaos of multiplayer and deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.poster.avif?t=1755692170\" width=594 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.webm?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/856884106158d0a68ebc22aa3eca11bc.mp4?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of countless <strong>Cipactli Dynamics</strong> employees. Your newly allocated job is to explore the dark Office Creation and report the number of anomalies you find.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct answers progress you to the next stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incorrect answers will result in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.poster.avif?t=1755692170\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.webm?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/546e0ad456bd62ac372b6f12102f583f.mp4?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.poster.avif?t=1755692170\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.webm?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/594e67c248cb40881d4f3a139fcde353.mp4?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 human players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VOIP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient 'clicker' counter to keep track of anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lockers to hide in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team video feeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmaking and Steam Friend invitations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Petable Dog.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.poster.avif?t=1755692170\" width=594 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.webm?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/2932fa284fc7aa3b74f624cc1897efdf.mp4?t=1755692170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551100/extras/c0d1ea0d6acf93aa3ca3a965eebcd880.avif?t=1755692170\" data-has-big width=800 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For millennia, <strong>Cipactli Dynamics</strong> has stood as a beacon of resilience, wisdom, and progress. With roots reaching deep into the past, we have preserved traditions of strength and vision, adapting through the ages to shape the future. Our commitment to innovation, longevity, and influence has positioned us as an enduring force in industries across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Cipactli Dynamics, we believe in <strong>continuity beyond generations</strong>\u2014an unbroken chain of knowledge and power that stretches from the world\u2019s earliest civilizations into the boundless possibilities of tomorrow. Our methods are time-honoured, our reach unparalleled, and our <strong>dedication to what lies beyond</strong> remains absolute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The past is our foundation. The future is our domain.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "They See Us is a multiplayer horror game built for creepy vibes, scream-worthy jump scares and hilarious co-op tension. Work together to spot terrifying anomalies lurking in familiar places \u2013 before they find you!",
